--- !u!1001 &1254057005
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 194820477288863327, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 283495610418290967, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: All the substances around us are made of matter, even the air we breathe!
        T
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 512829998547794065, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: This ceramic cup of water shows two states of matter. The ceramic cup
        is a solid, and the water inside is a liquid. Both have mass and take up
        space. The cup keeps its shape, while the water takes the shape of its container
        without changing volume. T
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 667374689045672163, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1080302726309932447, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1376496176762018904, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Today we are going to perform experiments to determine what makes up
        matter. T
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1376496176762018904, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_margin.w
      value: -25.497772
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1376496176762018904, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_margin.y
      value: -21.328453
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1376496176762018904, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_enableWordWrapping
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1890951032433948784, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: New Canvas
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2074889509050986068, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: This is the shadow cast by the cube. The cube blocks some of the light
        from the light source, so less light reaches this part of the table. The
        shadow shows where the light is blocked. The cube has mass and takes up space,
        but the shadow itself has no mass. T
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2074889509050986068, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontColor32.rgba
      value: 4278190080
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2216788984882221952, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Sugar cubes are solids with mass and volume. When a cube dissolves,
        its tiny sugar particles spread through the water. The sugar is still there,
        but its particles are too small to see. This is a great example of matter
        that can be divided into tiny particles that are too small to be seen. T
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2216788984882221952, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontColor32.rgba
      value: 4278190080
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2418778747696834921, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2885183956705739635, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2986331126027814725, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Here we are in the lab! Let\u2019s investigate matter. T"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3226869167794666347, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Let's move into the next room. You can move around with the WASD keys
        or the arrow keys. T
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3424252236706304315, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3564205943545871993, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Good morning scientist. T
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3564205943545871993, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_margin.w
      value: -25.322678
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
