      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4378727908858309690, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4529810050646013760, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: On this table are a ceramic cup filled with water and a pile of sugar
        cubes. Click either item to learn about its properties. Click the cross to
        leave the table.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4563303506170522818, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Select all correct statements about the mass and volume of this sample.
        T
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6412335047596291952, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: The balled up piece of paper is a solid. It has mass and takes up space.
        Like other solids, it keeps its shape when you move it from one container
        to another. T
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6437471531436795324, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: This lamp produces light. When light hits the table, some of it reflects
        off the surface and reaches your eyes, allowing you to see it. T
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6437471531436795324, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontColor32.rgba
      value: 4278190080
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6449426002210829547, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: The stretchy rubber is a solid, and the air inside is a mixture of gases.
        Both have mass and take up space. The air spreads out to fill the balloon,
        and adding more air stretches the rubber. T
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6449426002210829547, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontColor32.rgba
      value: 4278190080
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
